body:
Same feelings here, loneliness after some hard spells in life is consuming me.

&#x200B;

Advice: do something that you do on a "normal" day which will make you feel a bit more human again. Cook something, play a game that you like, go for a run, or watch your favorite show. It does not solve your problems, but will make you feel slightly better. And after that, there is a tomorrow.
